{"seq":1,"slug":"lc0416-partition-equal-subset-sum","title":"LeetCode 416 分割等和子集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0416-partition-equal-subset-sum","wordCount":944,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-416-分割等和子集\">LeetCode 416 分割等和子集</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给你一个只包含正整数的非空数组 <code>nums</code>。请你判断是否可以将这个数组分割成两个子集，使得两个子集的元素和相等。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 ≤ nums.length ≤ 200</li>\n<li>1 ≤ nums[i] ≤ 100</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [1,5,11,5] 输出：true解释：数组可以分割成 [1, 5, 5] 和 [11]。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [1,2,3,5] 输出：false解释：数组不能分割成两个元素和相等的子集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题的关键转化是：将数组分割成两个等和子集，等价于在数组中找到一个子集，使其元素和等于数组总和的一半。</p>\n<p>设数组总和为 <code>sum</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果 <code>sum</code> 为奇数，直接返回 <code>false</code>（无法等分）</li>\n<li>如果 <code>sum</code> 为偶数，问题转化为：能否从数组中选出若干元素，使其和恰好等于 <code>sum / 2</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>这就是一个标准的 <strong>0-1 背包问题</strong>：每个元素只能选一次（放入&quot;背包&quot;或不放），&quot;背包容量&quot;为 <code>sum / 2</code>，判断能否恰好装满。</p>\n<p><strong>状态定义</strong>：<code>dp[j]</code> 表示能否用数组中的元素凑出和为 <code>j</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>状态转移方程</strong>：<code>dp[j] = dp[j] || dp[j - nums[i]]</code></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>dp[j]</code>（不选 <code>nums[i]</code>）：不放入当前元素，保持原状</li>\n<li><code>dp[j - nums[i]]</code>（选 <code>nums[i]</code>）：如果去掉 <code>nums[i]</code> 后的和 <code>j - nums[i]</code> 可达，那么加上 <code>nums[i]</code> 后和为 <code>j</code> 也可达</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力回溯</td>\n<td>O(2ⁿ)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>每个元素选或不选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二维 DP</td>\n<td>O(n × target)</td>\n<td>O(n × target)</td>\n<td>标准 0-1 背包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一维 DP</td>\n<td>O(n × target)</td>\n<td>O(target)</td>\n<td>空间优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>一维 DP（空间优化）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function canPartition(nums: number[]): boolean {&#10;  const sum = nums.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b, 0);&#10;&#10;  if (sum % 2 !== 0) return false;&#10;&#10;  const target = sum / 2;&#10;  const dp = new Array(target + 1).fill(false);&#10;  dp[0] = true;&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums) {&#10;    for (let j = target; j &gt;= num; j--) {&#10;      dp[j] = dp[j] || dp[j - num];&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[target];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> canPartition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> target</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(target </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  dp[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dp[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[j] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dp[target];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>先计算数组总和，奇数直接返回 <code>false</code></li>\n<li>目标值 <code>target = sum / 2</code></li>\n<li><code>dp[0] = true</code>：和为 0 可以通过不选任何元素达成</li>\n<li>外层遍历每个元素 <code>num</code></li>\n<li><strong>内层从大到小遍历</strong>（<code>j</code> 从 <code>target</code> 到 <code>num</code>）：这是 0-1 背包的关键——逆序遍历确保每个元素只使用一次</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>为什么必须逆序遍历？</strong></p>\n<p>如果正序遍历，<code>dp[j - num]</code> 可能在当前轮次已经被更新过（包含了当前元素的影响），导致同一个元素被重复使用。逆序遍历时，<code>dp[j - num]</code> 还是上一轮的值，保证了每个元素最多使用一次。</p>\n<p>这与 LC #322（零钱兑换）形成鲜明对比：零钱兑换是完全背包（每枚硬币可无限使用），所以正序遍历。</p>\n<p><strong>二维 DP 版本（便于理解）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function canPartition2D(nums: number[]): boolean {&#10;  const sum = nums.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b, 0);&#10;  if (sum % 2 !== 0) return false;&#10;&#10;  const target = sum / 2;&#10;  const n = nums.length;&#10;  const dp: boolean[][] = Array.from({ length: n + 1 }, () =&gt; new Array(target + 1).fill(false));&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt;= n; i++) dp[i][0] = true;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt;= n; i++) {&#10;    for (let j = 1; j &lt;= target; j++) {&#10;      dp[i][j] = dp[i - 1][j];&#10;      if (j &gt;= nums[i - 1]) {&#10;        dp[i][j] = dp[i][j] || dp[i - 1][j - nums[i - 1]];&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return dp[n][target];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> canPartition2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24